    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπανίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make rise up and depart, send away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν στρατιήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.156
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.133
			</span></i>; <i>cause to depart,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς Ἀθηναίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.70
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, with aor. 2 and pf.
			
				Act.
			, and fut.
			
				Med.
			, <i>arise and go away, depart again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.87
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῆς πόλιος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς Μακεδονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.61
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ποτειδαίας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				139
			</span></i>; esp. <i>leave one's country, emigrate,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
